as. </font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">(2) The Corporation's Non-PEO NEOs consist of Denise Lindsay and Clarence A. Martindell for 2025 and 2024. </font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Below is a summary of the adjustments used to determine compensation &#34;actually paid&#34; for the Corporation's PEO and Non-PEO NEOs&#58;</font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:38.871%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.364%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:8.928%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:8.928%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:8.504%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:8.645%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:8.928%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:8.932%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="6" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><div style="margin-bottom:0.05pt;margin-top:0.05pt;text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">2025</font></div></td><td colspan="6" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><div style="margin-bottom:0.05pt;margin-top:0.05pt;text-align:center"><font style="color:#